    "preamble": "V.Balamurali vs The Commissioner on 16 June, 2017 Author: M.Sundar Bench: M.Sathyanarayanan, M.Sundar In The High Court Of Judicature At Madras Dated:16.06.2017 Coram: The Honourable Mr. Justice M.Sathyanarayanan And The Honourable Mr. Justice M.Sundar W.P.No.14945 / 2017 V.Balamurali .. Petitioner Vs 1.The Commissioner, Corporation of Chennai, Chennai-600 003. 2.The Chairperson/Zonal Executive Engineer Zone-11, Corporation of Chennai, (The Township Vending Committee) Chennai-600 021 .. Respondents Prayer:- Writ Petition filed under Article 226 of the Constitution of India praying for i For Petitioner : Mr.V.Balamurali For Respondents : Mr.A.Nagarajan Order",
    "facts": "",
    "arguments": "2 The petitioner, in the affidavit filed in support of this writ petition would aver among other things that he is otherwise abled [physically challenged] and he is running a Bunk Shop in Ward No.143, Zone-11, Nolambur Scheme-1, Dominos Pizza Corner, 5th Main Road Junction, Mugapair East, Chennai-37 and he is selling Tea, Coffee and Snacks / food items in a hygenic manner and also in strict compliance of the Food Safety Standard.",
